A polished Chinese lifestyle recruitment poster for a product photography side hustle platform. Vertical 9:16 mobile poster. Soft cream, blush pink and light gold palette. A young East Asian woman at home casually photographing a fashion/beauty product on a clean desk near a window, natural daylight, relaxed confident smile. Modern clean commercial layout with large empty text space at top and bottom for Chinese headlines. Soft shadows, airy white space, trustworthy feminine aesthetic, not flashy, not luxury-glam, no watermark, high resolution.
```

